#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/isomorphic-lib-v21/.ai/docs/taon-building-blocks/contexts.component.html:24
msgid "Use"
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/isomorphic-lib-v21/.ai/docs/taon-building-blocks/contexts.component.html:24
msgid "where the application needs Taon's standard base context. Add controllers, entities, repositories, providers, subscribers, migrations, and database settings to the context configuration that owns them. Keep class names and context names unique where Taon uses them for registration or generated API paths."
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/isomorphic-lib-v21/.ai/docs/taon-building-blocks/contexts.component.html:29
msgid "Initialization"
msgstr ""

#: src/lib/generated-docs-from-md-files/isomorphic-lib-v21/.ai/docs/taon-building-blocks/contexts.component.html:30
msgid "Initialize each active context before using its APIs or resolving its\nregistered services. Abstract contexts are included by active contexts rather\nthan initialized as application entry points. Database and migration behavior\ndepends on the active context's configuration; see\n<a [href]=\"baseHref + '/isomorphic-lib-v21/' + &quot;.ai/docs/taon-building-blocks/migrations.md&quot;\">Migrations</a>."
msgstr ""

